#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Builds foundations of quantum computing, technology, and business applications."
msgstr "Construye las bases de la computación cuántica, la tecnología y las aplicaciones empresariales."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Descripción general {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Designed by IBM Quantum&reg; experts, this course covers the essentials of quantum computing and applications for business. Learn about this new computing paradigm, how it works, and its potential to address incredibly complex business problems. Complete the course to earn your IBM Quantum Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr "Este curso, desarrollado por expertos de IBM Quantum&reg;, enseña lo esencial sobre la computación cuántica y sus aplicaciones para empresas. Aprenderás sobre este nuevo paradigma computacional, comprenderás cómo funciona y descubrirás cómo puede ayudar a resolver problemas empresariales increíblemente complejos. Completa el curso y obtén tu insignia IBM Quantum Business Foundations.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Examen {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum business foundations, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training linked below. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. Once you have passed the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Para obtener tu insignia de Quantum Business Foundations, realiza el examen en IBM&reg; Training, enlazado a continuación. Este examen está diseñado para realizarse después de trabajar las lecciones de este curso. Una vez que apruebes, Credly te informará que has recibido una insignia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Examen](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Awarded Badge {#awarded-badge}"
msgstr "Insignia otorgada {#awarded-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credly {#credly}"
msgstr "Credly {#credly}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/). IBM employees can view the IBM Internal Privacy Statement [here](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice).\n"
msgstr "NOTA: IBM utiliza los servicios de Credly, un proveedor externo de procesamiento de datos autorizado por IBM con sede en los Estados Unidos, para apoyar la administración del programa IBM Digital Badge. Para poder emitirte un IBM Digital Badge, tus datos personales (nombre, dirección de correo electrónico e insignia obtenida) se compartirán con Credly. Recibirás una notificación por correo electrónico de Credly con instrucciones para canjear la insignia. Tus datos personales se utilizarán para la emisión de tu insignia, así como para informes del programa y fines operativos. IBM puede compartir los datos personales recopilados con subsidiarias de IBM y terceros en todo el mundo. Se tratarán de manera consistente con las prácticas de privacidad de IBM. La declaración de privacidad de IBM puede consultarse [aquí](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/). Los empleados de IBM pueden consultar la declaración de privacidad interna de IBM [aquí](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice).\n"
